.SH NAME
keyword_profiles \- Create the catalog profiles of the UniProt keyword enrichment result, the terms are
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIkeyword_profiles(\fBenrichment\fR as <generic> EnrichmentResult[], 
\fBkeywords\fR as <generic> dataframe, 
\fBtop\fR as integer = 4);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Create the catalog profiles of the UniProt keyword enrichment result, the terms are
 grouped by the keyword category.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBenrichment\fB \fR\- the UniProt keyword enrichment analysis result set.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBkeywords\fB \fR\- 
 the UniProt keyword table data, the required columns are \fBKeyword ID\fR and \fBCategory\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtop\fB \fR\- the number of the most significant keywords that will be kept in each category. Default \fB4\fR.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [CatalogProfiles](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.ComponentModel.Annotation.CatalogProfiles) object, the name of each catalog is the keyword category
 and the value is the top enriched keywords of that category.
.PP
